H('414.d.1',3,"A flight-test engineer sees data showing a wing fitting is overstressed but the test program is behind schedule. The ethical choice is to:","report the data and recommend a fix",["delete the data point","skip the report","wait until the next test"],"Safety data must be reported honestly.")
H('414.d.1',4,"A licensed engineer is asked to seal drawings for an airframe design outside her field of expertise. The ethical response is to:","decline until a qualified engineer reviews it",["seal it anyway","guess at the calculations","let an intern sign"],"Engineers practice only within their competence.")
