H('414.d.3.F',4,"If wind-tunnel time costs 2,000 dollars per day and the plan needs 5 days, the wind-tunnel budget line is:","10,000 dollars",["2,005 dollars","7,000 dollars","400 dollars"],"2,000 x 5 = 10,000.")
H('414.d.3.G',3,"Management of change requires that a proposed modification to a flight-critical part be:","reviewed and approved before it is made",["made first and checked later","kept secret","made by anyone"],"MOC prevents untracked changes.")
