H('414.d.4.B',4,"In an Agile team, a short daily meeting where members share progress and blockers is a:","stand-up",["sleep-in","walk-out","sit-down dinner"],"Stand-ups keep everyone aligned.")
H('414.d.4.C',3,"When critiquing a teammate's flight-control diagram, the 'analyzing' step asks:","how the parts relate to each other",["who drew it","what color is it","how long it took"],"Analysis examines relationships.")
