H('414.d.4.D',3,"A team that agrees to hold weekly status meetings and rotate note-taking has developed an:","action plan to support teamwork",["accident","delay","excuse"],"Plans formalize teamwork.")
H('414.d.4.D',4,"To make a team action plan effective, each step should have an owner and a:","target date",["nickname","password","slogan"],"Ownership and dates drive follow-through.")
H('414.d.4.E',3,"A helpful way to critique a teammate's report is to point to a specific section and explain how to:","improve it",["erase it","ignore it","insult it"],"Specific advice is useful.")
H('414.d.4.E',4,"Modeling effective critique for newer team members means demonstrating feedback that is:","specific, respectful, and tied to goals",["vague and harsh","sarcastic","rare"],"Good examples teach good habits.")
