H('414.d.6.B',4,"A requirement to cruise at 200 km/h at 3,000 m might generate a sub-requirement for the engine to deliver adequate:","thrust or power at altitude",["paint adhesion","cabin music","seat comfort"],"Performance needs propulsion.")
