H('414.d.10.G',4,"A smoother aircraft surface reduces drag because it lowers:","skin friction",["lift","weight","thrust"],"Smooth surfaces reduce friction drag.")
H('414.d.11.A',3,"To find the center of gravity of an aircraft, engineers sum the moments of each weight about a reference and divide by the:","total weight",["total length","number of parts","speed"],"CG = sum of moments / total weight.")
