H('415.d.8.B',4,"Four project phases are planning, construction, operation, and the idea stage. The idea stage that comes first is called:","conception",["operation","construction","closeout only"],"Conception comes first.")
H('415.d.9.A',3,"A feasibility study for a new bridge would examine technical, financial, and:","environmental factors",["fashion factors","music factors","sports factors"],"Feasibility has several dimensions.")
